<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carpenter Technology.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carpenter Technology.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Carpenter Technology Corp as a buy, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Carpenter Technology gained 1/4 to 39-3/4.</p>
